# (1) ... Mode No. used in `mode.h' of source file.
# (2) ... Any keys except for ESC can be set to `F-?' (from F-0 to F-9) 
	  up to 2-stroke.
# (3) ... Though up to 2-stroke, only `F-?' or ESC can be used as the
#	  first key.  (Since K-54 and K-65 are also the first key,
#	  set either `F-?' or ESC.)
